{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勝義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無相隨形好故，是則法身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "愚夫法聖人法無二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無生無滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非業異熟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陀羅\n尼法要空無相無願隨入法界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非奢摩他毘鉢舍那一切法隨入真如"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切法剎那無盡無壞無身，本寂故\n隨入一切法涅槃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T19n1009_p0678a17"}
